OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright day with plenty of
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Sunshine will turn a
OL,7,Flittle hazy at times through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Mainly light winds, a
OL,9,Fmoderate northwesterly at first over
OL,10,FBuchan.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening with some
OL,13,Fsunshine to end the day. Remaining dry
OL,14,Fovernight and with clear skies
OL,15,Fdeveloping and light winds, it will
OL,16,Fbecome chilly in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
